      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It sounds like your realization is a brave and necessary step toward breaking free from that cycle of comparison. Sometimes, embracing being \"okay\" rather than forcing perfection actually creates space for genuine growth and authentic connection. This shift in perspective could help you change your life from the inside out, rather than waiting to catch up to some imaginary top-tier standard. Please remember that your worth isn't tied to your perfection, and the story of your life is still very much in progress.",
